              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī lūūlū tūhaye ginehe? Gūlī gīkī, a banhū ba mahanga abo baalī batabūkoobaga ū būtūngīlīja, ū būtūngīlīja baabūpandīkile; gwike būtūngīlīja bo kūfuma mu kūzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo a Baisilaeli abo bakūgemaga kūkooba būtūngīlīja bo kūfuma mu shilagīlo, a bene baduumile ū kūshishikīlīja ī shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibūlī? Īlī kūlwa nguno batūtūmamīlaga kūzunya, alīyo bakūgaganījaga kūkooba mu nzīla ya shītwa; hūna lūūlū bipamile a h'iwe lya kwipamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
